<%- include("partials/_header") %>

<main class="main">
  <div class="label-title">
    <h4>ABOUT SILLY STORIES:</h4>
  </div>

  <p class="description">
    Silly Stories began in May 2020 with a simple idea: what if strangers wrote
    a story together without knowing where it would go?
    <br />
    <br />
    One person leaves a sentence, and the next carries the story forward from
    that single clue. No one knows where it will lead.
    <br />
    <br />
    After <%= sentenceLimit %> sentences, the pieces come together. The tale
    joins the Silly Archive, and a blank page awaits the next adventure.

    <br />
    <br />
    This project was resurrected in September 2026.
  </p>

  <div class="label-title" id="how-to-play">
    <h4>HOW TO PLAY:</h4>
  </div>
  <p class="description">
    <b>1.</b> Together, you and other players write a story—one sentence at a
    time.
    <br />
    <b>2.</b> The twist? You can only see the last sentence. Read it, then write
    what happens next.
    <br />
    <b>3.</b> Press Enter to pass your sentence to the next writer.
    <br />
    <b>4.</b> Voilà! You've added to the story!
    <br />
    <span hidden>
      <b>5.</b> Want the finished story? Check the box, enter your email, and
      we'll send it your way!
      <br />
    </span>
  </p>

  <p class="description">
    Illustrations by <a href="https://www.aleywild.com/" target="_blank" >Aley Wild</a>.
  </p>

  <%- include("partials/_menu") %>
</main>
</body>

</html>
